# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Rule order: first matching rule wins. Static files in /dist are served BEFORE
# these rules, so real assets (JS, CSS, images, sitemap.xml, robots.txt) are
# never intercepted by the SPA fallback.

