/specialists/dr-jose-olive       /specialists#dr-jose-olive       301
/specialists/dr-j-sowmiya        /specialists#dr-j-sowmiya        301
/specialists/dr-meenakshi        /specialists#dr-meenakshi        301

# ── SPA fallback ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Serve index.html for any path that does not match a real static file.
# Cloudflare Pages checks the filesystem first; this only fires for misses.
/*  /index.html  200

